Cell["\<\
El m\[AAcute]ximo com\[UAcute]n divisor es el \[UAcute]ltimo resto no nulo
1 + x + 4 x2 \[UAcute]nico salvo asociados\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97978821972974*^9, 
  3.9797882400065327`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"58a17851-16c3-b64a-a12a-\
